@prefix cc: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/mfact-command-center/ontology#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/> .

cc:AutonomicSimulation a prov:Activity .
cc:SimulationParameter a prov:Entity .
cc:SimulationObservation a sosa:Observation ; prov:wasGeneratedBy cc:AutonomicSimulation .
cc:AutonomicSimulation prov:used cc:SimulationParameter .
